     // A: k columns, n rows => [ne03, ne02, n, k]
     // B: k columns, m rows  (i.e. we transpose it internally) => [ne03 * x, ne02 * y, m, k]
     // result is n columns, m rows => [ne03 * x, ne02 * y, m, n]
